precharge pump
* GPIO: 10 kHz burst 0..3.3 V for 100 ms, then held (HI case) -- source 40 ohm
.model DSCH D(IS=2e-7 N=1.1 RS=5 CJO=10p BV=30)
.model QN NPN(IS=6.7e-15 BF=100 CJE=8p CJC=4p VAF=74 TF=300p TR=240n)
V1 g 0 PWL FILE=drv_hi.txt
Ro g p 40
Rs p c1 1k
C1 c1 a 10n
D1 0 a DSCH
D2 a b DSCH
C2 b 0 100n
R2 b 0 100k
Rb b base 47k
Rbe base 0 100k
* collector: gate divider of Q2 from a 14.6 V source (Rgs 100k, Rg 27k)
Vbp vbp 0 14.6
Rgs vbp g2 100k
Rg g2 col 27k
Cgs vbp g2 1.65n
Q1 col base 0 QN
.control
tran 1u 200m 0 1u
meas tran vbmin MIN v(b) from=50m to=99m
meas tran vbmax MAX v(b) from=50m to=99m
meas tran vsgmin MIN par('v(vbp)-v(g2)') from=50m to=99m
meas tran ton WHEN par('v(vbp)-v(g2)')=4 RISE=1
meas tran toff WHEN par('v(vbp)-v(g2)')=1 FALL=LAST
meas tran vsgend MAX par('v(vbp)-v(g2)') from=150m to=200m
.endc
.end
